[Report : PW Daily Project List]
Use : DSP Template
Form : PW DPR List Form
Title : "Daily Project Report (PesoWise)"

[Form : PW DPR List Form]
Set : PW Active Title : "Daily Project Report"
Part : PW Shell Header Part, PW DPR Col Head Part, PW DPR Body Part, PW DPR Footer Part
Height : 100 % Screen
Width : 100 % Screen

[Part : PW DPR Col Head Part]
Lines : PW DPR Col Head Line
Border : Thin Bottom

[Line : PW DPR Col Head Line]
Fields : PW DPR C Date, PW DPR C Vch, PW DPR C Proj, PW DPR C Emp, PW DPR C Loc, PW DPR C Pres, PW DPR C Exp, PW DPR C Rem

[Field : PW DPR C Date]
Use : Short Name Field
Set as : "Date"
Style : PW Col Head Style
Width : 11
[Field : PW DPR C Vch]
Use : Short Name Field
Set as : "Voucher No."
Style : PW Col Head Style
Width : 11
[Field : PW DPR C Proj]
Use : Short Name Field
Set as : "Project"
Style : PW Col Head Style
Width : 20
[Field : PW DPR C Emp]
Use : Short Name Field
Set as : "Employee"
Style : PW Col Head Style
Width : 18
[Field : PW DPR C Loc]
Use : Short Name Field
Set as : "Location"
Style : PW Col Head Style
Width : 14
[Field : PW DPR C Pres]
Use : Short Name Field
Set as : "Presence"
Style : PW Col Head Style
Width : 9
[Field : PW DPR C Exp]
Use : Short Name Field
Set as : "Expense"
Style : PW Col Head Style
Width : 12
Align : Right
[Field : PW DPR C Rem]
Use : Short Name Field
Set as : "Remarks"
Style : PW Col Head Style
Width : 22

[Part : PW DPR Body Part]
Lines : PW DPR Data Line
Repeat : PW DPR Data Line : PW DPR Latest
Scroll : Vertical
Common Border : Yes

[Line : PW DPR Data Line]
Key : PW DPR Line Enter
Fields : PW DPR D Date, PW DPR D Vch, PW DPR D Proj, PW DPR D Emp, PW DPR D Loc, PW DPR D Pres, PW DPR D Exp, PW DPR D Rem

[Field : PW DPR D Date]
Use : Name Field
Set as : $$If:$$IsEmpty:@@PWFlat1:$PESOWISE_DPR_TRACK_DATE:@@PWFlat1
Width : 11
[Field : PW DPR D Vch]
Use : Name Field
Set as : $$If:$$IsEmpty:@@PWFlat2:$PESOWISE_DPR_VOUCHER_NO:@@PWFlat2
Width : 11
[Field : PW DPR D Proj]
Use : Name Field
Set as : $$If:$$IsEmpty:@@PWFlat4:$PESOWISE_DPR_PROJECT_NAME:@@PWFlat4
Width : 20
[Field : PW DPR D Emp]
Use : Name Field
Set as : $$If:$$IsEmpty:@@PWFlat5:$PESOWISE_DPR_EMPLOYEE:@@PWFlat5
Width : 18
[Field : PW DPR D Loc]
Use : Name Field
Set as : $$If:$$IsEmpty:@@PWFlat7:$PESOWISE_DPR_LOCATION:@@PWFlat7
Width : 14
[Field : PW DPR D Pres]
Use : Name Field
Set as : @@PWDPRPresenceLabel
Width : 9
[Field : PW DPR D Exp]
Use : Amount Field
Set as : @@PWDPRRowTotal
Width : 12
[Field : PW DPR D Rem]
Use : Name Field
Set as : $$If:$$IsEmpty:@@PWFlat8:$PESOWISE_DPR_REMARKS:@@PWFlat8
Width : 22

[Key : PW DPR Line Enter]
Key : Enter
Action : CALL : PW DPR Show Detail

[Function : PW DPR Show Detail]
01 : SET : SV PW Ledger Name : $Name
02 : Display : PW Daily Project Detail

[Part : PW DPR Footer Part]
Lines : PW DPR Footer Line
Border : Thin Top

[Line : PW DPR Footer Line]
Fields : PW DPR Foot Hint

[Field : PW DPR Foot Hint]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "Select a row and press Enter for expense breakdown. Esc returns from detail."
Style : PW Subtitle Style
Full Width : Yes

[Report : PW Daily Project Detail]
Use : DSP Template
Form : PW DPR Detail Form
Title : "Daily Project Details"

[Form : PW DPR Detail Form]
Part : PW DPR Det Head, PW DPR Det Body
Height : 100 % Screen
Width : 100 % Screen

[Part : PW DPR Det Head]
Lines : PW DPR Det Title, PW DPR Det Hint
[Line : PW DPR Det Title]
Field : PW DPR Det Title F
[Field : PW DPR Det Title F]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "Daily Project Details"
Style : PW Title Style
Full Width : Yes
[Line : PW DPR Det Hint]
Field : PW DPR Det Hint F
[Field : PW DPR Det Hint F]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "Press Esc to return to the list."
Style : PW Subtitle Style
Full Width : Yes

[Part : PW DPR Det Body]
Part : PW DPR Det Block
Repeat : PW DPR Det Block : PW Selected Ledger One
Scroll : Vertical

[Part : PW DPR Det Block]
Lines : PW DPR Sec G, PW DPR Det R1, PW DPR Det R2, PW DPR Det R3, PW DPR Det R4, PW DPR Det R5, PW DPR Det R6
Lines : PW DPR Sec P, PW DPR Det R7, PW DPR Det R8
Lines : PW DPR Sec E, PW DPR Det R9, PW DPR Det R10, PW DPR Det R11, PW DPR Det R12, PW DPR Det R13, PW DPR Det R14, PW DPR Det R15, PW DPR Det R16, PW DPR Det R17
Lines : PW DPR Sec O, PW DPR Det R18, PW DPR Det R19

[Line : PW DPR Sec G]
Field : PW DPR Sec G F
[Field : PW DPR Sec G F]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "GENERAL"
Style : PW Col Head Style
Full Width : Yes

[Line : PW DPR Sec P]
Field : PW DPR Sec P F
[Field : PW DPR Sec P F]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "PROJECT"
Style : PW Col Head Style
Full Width : Yes

[Line : PW DPR Sec E]
Field : PW DPR Sec E F
[Field : PW DPR Sec E F]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "EXPENSE BREAKDOWN"
Style : PW Col Head Style
Full Width : Yes

[Line : PW DPR Sec O]
Field : PW DPR Sec O F
[Field : PW DPR Sec O F]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "OTHER"
Style : PW Col Head Style
Full Width : Yes

[Line : PW DPR Det R1]
Fields : PW DPR L1, PW DPR V1
[Field : PW DPR L1]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "Track Date"
Width : 28
[Field : PW DPR V1]
Use : Name Field
Set as : $$If:$$IsEmpty:@@PWFlat1:$PESOWISE_DPR_TRACK_DATE:@@PWFlat1
Width : 52

[Line : PW DPR Det R2]
Fields : PW DPR L2, PW DPR V2
[Field : PW DPR L2]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "Voucher No."
Width : 28
[Field : PW DPR V2]
Use : Name Field
Set as : $$If:$$IsEmpty:@@PWFlat2:$PESOWISE_DPR_VOUCHER_NO:@@PWFlat2
Width : 52

[Line : PW DPR Det R3]
Fields : PW DPR L3, PW DPR V3
[Field : PW DPR L3]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "Employee"
Width : 28
[Field : PW DPR V3]
Use : Name Field
Set as : $$If:$$IsEmpty:@@PWFlat5:$PESOWISE_DPR_EMPLOYEE:@@PWFlat5
Width : 52

[Line : PW DPR Det R4]
Fields : PW DPR L4, PW DPR V4
[Field : PW DPR L4]
Use : Name Field
Set as : "Employee Code"
Width : 28
[Field : PW DPR V4]
Use : Name Field
